It's like being praised by your mother, you keep stepping back...

613
00:49:50,072 --> 00:49:54,072
どうぞどうぞ、そう、なんか、なんか恥ずかしいって気持ちになっちゃうかもしれない。
Go ahead, please, yeah, it might make you feel kind of embarrassed.

614
00:49:54,072 --> 00:49:57,072
